<title>INDIA: India Essar, SI Shipping boards approve merger plan.</title>
<headline>India Essar, SI Shipping boards approve merger plan.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The boards of Essar Shipping Ltd and South India Shipping Corporation Ltd on Wednesday approved a proposed merger of the two firms, Essar Shipping said in a statement.</p>
</text>
